        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Are you looking for the best SEO Shopify App for your Shopify store? But with lots of available options, not able to make an informed decision? Then, stay with us to explore 5 must-have Shopify SEO apps to drive more sales.",
          "bold": true,
          "italic": true
